{"seq":3,"slug":"weight-encumbrance","title":"负重与容量约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/inventory-systems/weight-encumbrance","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"负重与容量约束\">负重与容量约束</h1><p>如果背包是无底洞，玩家就会捡走一切、永不取舍，物品也随之贬值。负重与容量约束的全部意义，是给背包施加一道天花板，把「拿什么、丢什么」变成一个需要权衡的决策。《上古卷轴》《辐射》用重量上限逼你权衡，《暗黑》用 <a href=\"grid-slot-inventory\">网格空间</a> 逼你整理，多数 MMO 用格子数做简单约束——它们是三种不同的稀缺模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容量约束有三种正交的建模方式：格子数（离散计数）、重量（连续标量）、体积（连续标量，常与重量并用）。它们可以单独使用，也可叠加；超出约束后的惩罚（无法拾取、移动减速、无法奔跑）则把约束从硬墙变成有梯度的张力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[容量约束模型] --&gt; B[格子数&lt;br/&gt;离散·一物占N格]&#10;  A --&gt; C[重量&lt;br/&gt;连续·sum weight&lt;=Max]&#10;  A --&gt; D[体积&lt;br/&gt;连续·常与重量并用]&#10;  B --&gt; E{超出?}&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|硬约束| F[拒绝拾取]&#10;  E --&gt;|软约束| G[超重惩罚&lt;br/&gt;减速/禁奔/禁快旅]\">flowchart TD\n  A[容量约束模型] --&gt; B[格子数&lt;br/&gt;离散·一物占N格]\n  A --&gt; C[重量&lt;br/&gt;连续·sum weight&lt;=Max]\n  A --&gt; D[体积&lt;br/&gt;连续·常与重量并用]\n  B --&gt; E{超出?}\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|硬约束| F[拒绝拾取]\n  E --&gt;|软约束| G[超重惩罚&lt;br/&gt;减速/禁奔/禁快旅]</pre><p>格子数约束最简单、对玩家最透明，但与物品「轻重大小」的直觉脱节。重量约束贴近现实直觉，能让「捡满一背包金属锭」产生真实负担，但需要给每件物品标注重量。体积约束则解决「重量轻但占地方」的物品（如蓬松的衣物）。选哪种取决于你想要的真实感与摩擦度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束模型</th>\n<th>数据需求</th>\n<th>玩家直觉</th>\n<th>超限惩罚常见做法</th>\n<th>代表作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格子数</td>\n<td>物品占格数</td>\n<td>中（抽象）</td>\n<td>拒绝拾取</td>\n<td>多数 MMORPG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重量</td>\n<td>每物品重量</td>\n<td>高（贴近现实）</td>\n<td>减速、禁奔、禁快旅</td>\n<td>上古卷轴、辐射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>每物品体积</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>拒绝放入</td>\n<td>部分硬核生存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格空间</td>\n<td>矩形足迹</td>\n<td>高（空间感）</td>\n<td>放不下</td>\n<td>暗黑、塔科夫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重量约束-连续标量与超重惩罚\">重量约束：连续标量与超重惩罚</h2><p>重量约束把背包容量建模为一个连续标量：当前总重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\sum_i w_i \\cdot n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（各物品重量乘数量之和）必须不超过角色承重上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。承重上限通常不是常数，而是随力量属性成长：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>STR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max} = W_{base} + k \\cdot \\text{STR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">STR</span></span></span></span></span></span>，这把背包容量接入了角色成长曲线，让「力量加点」有了背包外的第二重收益。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public bool TryAddByWeight(ItemInstance item, int count) {&#10;    float add = item.Template.Weight * count;&#10;    if (currentWeight + add &gt; MaxWeight) return false;   // 硬约束：拒绝&#10;    currentWeight += add;&#10;    // ... 实际放入&#10;    return true;&#10;}&#10;public EncumbranceState GetState() =&gt;&#10;    currentWeight &lt;= MaxWeight        ? EncumbranceState.Normal&#10;  : currentWeight &lt;= MaxWeight * 1.5f ? EncumbranceState.Overweight  // 软超重&#10;  :                                     EncumbranceState.Immobile;   // 完全不能动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public bool TryAddByWeight(ItemInstance item, int count) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float add = item.Template.Weight * count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (currentWeight + add > MaxWeight) return false;   // 硬约束：拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    currentWeight += add;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... 实际放入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public EncumbranceState GetState() =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    currentWeight &#x3C;= MaxWeight        ? EncumbranceState.Normal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  : currentWeight &#x3C;= MaxWeight * 1.5f ? EncumbranceState.Overweight  // 软超重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  :                                     EncumbranceState.Immobile;   // 完全不能动</span></span></code></pre></div><p>软约束比硬约束更耐玩：与其在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处一刀切拒绝，不如允许超重但施加惩罚——移动减速、无法奔跑、无法快速旅行，逼玩家要么丢弃、要么忍受、要么往返清仓。这种「可超出但有代价」的设计制造了真实的负担管理张力，是上古卷轴系列的标志。承重随力量成长的设计，把容量与角色数值绑定，其平衡考量延伸到 <a href=\"../practice/economy-balance-loot\">掉落与经济平衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量作为经济的排水口\">容量作为经济的排水口</h2><p>负重不只是 UI 约束，它是整个游戏经济的一道排水口（sink）。当背包装满，玩家被迫做出选择：丢弃低价值物品、跑回城出售、或购买扩容。每一个选择都在消耗资源——时间、背包格、或扩容费用——从而把物品从经济中移除或减缓其涌入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[掉落涌入&lt;br/&gt;水龙头 faucet] --&gt; B[背包容量约束]&#10;  B --&gt; C{背包满?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[丢弃/出售/扩容]&#10;  D --&gt; E[物品离开背包&lt;br/&gt;排水口 sink]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| F[继续囤积]&#10;  F --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[掉落涌入&lt;br/&gt;水龙头 faucet] --&gt; B[背包容量约束]\n  B --&gt; C{背包满?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[丢弃/出售/扩容]\n  D --&gt; E[物品离开背包&lt;br/&gt;排水口 sink]\n  C --&gt;|否| F[继续囤积]\n  F --&gt; B</pre><p>这正是本 hub 与 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink\">游戏经济与平衡</a> 的接口所在：背包容量是经济模型里一个被精心调校的旋钮。容量给太松，玩家囤积无度、物品贬值、跑商需求消失；给太紧，玩家疲于管理、体验受挫。许多游戏用「付费扩容」把这道排水口直接变成收入来源，这又触及 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods\">商业化与 LiveOps</a> 的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反摩擦设计-在约束与体验间取平衡\">反摩擦设计：在约束与体验间取平衡</h2><p>约束太强会变成纯粹的烦扰。现代游戏发展出一系列「反摩擦」机制来保留约束的经济意义、同时削减无谓的管理负担：自动拾取并堆叠材料、关键材料无重量、远程出售/远程仓库、垃圾物品一键分解。这些机制的共同逻辑是——保留对「有意义物品」的约束，移除对「无意义物品」的约束。</p>\n<p>判断一项物品该不该计入约束，可问：玩家会因为它而做有趣的取舍吗？战利品装备会，所以它占格、计重；任务物品不会（且丢了会卡关），所以它进无限的任务物品栏；常用材料半会半不会，所以折中地给个高堆叠上限。把约束精确施加在「值得取舍」的物品上，是负重设计的最高境界。一键分解垃圾装备这类操作，还顺带喂给了 <a href=\"../practice/ux-feedback-loot\">掉落反馈与 UX</a> 里的「批量处理快感」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>容量约束有格子数、重量、体积三种正交模型，可叠加；超限惩罚把硬墙变成有梯度的张力。</li>\n<li>重量约束用连续标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=\\sum w_i n_i \\le W_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，承重常随力量成长，把容量接入角色曲线。</li>\n<li>软超重（可超出但减速/禁奔/禁快旅）比硬拒绝更耐玩。</li>\n<li>背包容量是经济的排水口，给太松物品贬值、给太紧体验受挫，是与经济 hub 的关键接口。</li>\n<li>反摩擦设计的逻辑是：把约束精确施加在「值得取舍」的物品上，移除对无意义物品的约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网格空间是另一种稀缺模型，见 <a href=\"grid-slot-inventory\">网格与槽位背包</a>；堆叠上限作为轻量约束见 <a href=\"stacking-equipment\">堆叠与装备栏</a>。</li>\n<li>容量作为经济旋钮见 <a href=\"../practice/economy-balance-loot\">掉落与经济平衡</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：水龙头-排水口模型见 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink\">游戏经济与平衡</a>；付费扩容见 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods\">商业化与 LiveOps</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"负重与容量约束","id":"负重与容量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重量约束：连续标量与超重惩罚","id":"重量约束-连续标量与超重惩罚"},{"level":2,"text":"容量作为经济的排水口","id":"容量作为经济的排水口"},{"level":2,"text":"反摩擦设计：在约束与体验间取平衡","id":"反摩擦设计-在约束与体验间取平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"堆叠与装备栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/inventory-systems/stacking-equipment"},"next":{"title":"掉落表与概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/loot-tables-drop-rates"}}